DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):
- Platform: Desktop Web SaaS (1440px canvas)
- Typography: Inter (sans-serif), font weights 400, 500, 600, 700. Monospace numbers in tables.
- Aesthetic: Modern Enterprise B2B SaaS, subtle 1px slate borders, high-density data, zero emojis.
- Iconography: Monoline SVG line icons only (Lucide/Heroicons style, 16–20px). No emojis.
- Palette:
  * Primary Sidebar: Deep Navy Slate (#0f172a) with Slate-800 borders (#1e293b)
  * Main Canvas: Subtle Slate Gray (#f8fafc)
  * Surface Cards: Pure White (#ffffff) with 1px border (#e2e8f0) and soft shadow
  * Brand Accent: Cobalt Royal Blue (#1d4ed8)
  * Status Badges:
    - Normal / In Stock / Good: Emerald Green (#16a34a, bg #dcfce7)
    - Warning / Low Stock / Expiring Soon: Amber (#d97706, bg #fef3c7)
    - Danger / Expired / Out of Stock: Crimson Red (#dc2626, bg #fee2e2)
    - Neutral / Meta: Slate (#475569, bg #f1f5f9)
Screen 1: Executive Inventory Dashboard
A high-density executive dashboard for SmartShelf, a commercial inventory and shelf-life tracking platform. Desktop web application, 1440px width, clean Inter typography, zero emojis.

DESIGN SYSTEM (REQUIRED):
- Platform: Desktop Web SaaS
- Theme: Dark slate sidebar (#0f172a), light gray content background (#f8fafc), white surface cards (#ffffff)
- Primary Accent: Cobalt Blue (#1d4ed8)
- Text: Slate-900 (#0f172a) for titles, Slate-600 (#475569) for descriptions
- Icons: Monoline vector line icons only (box, warning-triangle, clock, chart, layers). No emojis.

Page Structure:
1. Navigation Sidebar (Left, 260px width, background #0f172a):
   - Header: "SmartShelf" logo title in white Inter 700 with subtitle "Inventory Platform" in slate-400.
   - Section "Overview": "Dashboard" (active state with dark blue highlight #1e3a5f and white text).
   - Section "Inventory": "Inventory Catalog", "Add Product", "Edit Product", "Delete Product".
   - Section "Monitoring": "Alerts & Exceptions", "Reports & Export".
   - Section "System": "System Audit Log".
   - Footer: System date stamp and version tag "v1.2.0 Enterprise".

2. Top Header Bar:
   - Page Title: "Inventory Dashboard" with subtitle "Executive overview and real-time operational health".
   - Right Side Actions: "Quick Export" button and "+ Register Product" primary blue button.

3. KPI Metric Strip (5 equal cards in a horizontal row):
   - Card 1: "Catalog SKUs" -> Value "1,248" with "+12 this week" indicator.
   - Card 2: "Total Units" -> Value "38,420" units.
   - Card 3: "Stock Valuation" -> Value "Rs 4,829,350.00" with gross margin tag.
   - Card 4: "Expired Batches" -> Value "3" with red danger alert badge.
   - Card 5: "Low Stock Items" -> Value "14" with amber warning badge.

4. Operational Alert Banners:
   - High-priority banner in light red tint: "Critical Notice: 3 catalog batches have exceeded expiration dates. Immediate write-off required."
   - Secondary banner in amber tint: "Inventory Notice: 14 SKUs have fallen below minimum safety threshold."

5. Analytics Row (2 columns, 50/50 split):
   - Left Card: "Units by Category" bar chart showing volume distribution across Dairy, Beverages, Bakery, Produce, Packaged Goods.
   - Right Card: "Stock Health Breakdown" horizontal progress/bar chart showing In Stock (86%), Low Stock (11%), Out of Stock (3%).

6. Upcoming Expiration Timeline (Full width card):
   - Card title: "Upcoming Shelf Expirations (Next 30 Days)" with view all link.
   - Clean data table with columns: Product SKU, Product Name, Category, Units On Hand, Unit Price (Rs), Expiry Date, Days Remaining (pill badge), Status.

